      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>Enb\u0101r</em>:\u00a0It lies in the <em>vil\u0101yet-i \u2018Ir\u0101\u1e33</em> (province of Iraq), located on the bank of the <em>Fur\u0101t</em> (Euphrates River).\u00a0The first of the <em>\u1e2aulef\u0101-y\u0131 \u2018Abb\u0101siyye</em> (Abbasid caliphs)\u2014<em>Seff\u0101\u1e25</em> (al-Saff\u0101\u1e25)\u2014resided there.\u00a0There is also a village named <em>Enb\u0101r</em> in the vil\u0101yet of <em>C\u00fcrc\u0101n</em> (Gurg\u0101n).\u00a0<em>Eb\u00fc\u2019l-\u1e24asen \u2018Al\u012b Enb\u0101r\u012b</em> is named in relation to that village. [translation]</p>",
